  "bodyHash": "ET2B7iKsa5w=",
  "content": "<h1>Discord 聊天模組</h1><h2>這是一款 Minecraft 模組，用於將遊戲聊天與 Discord 結合、自訂聊天內容以及顯示聊天圖片。</h2><h3><strong>快速開始：</strong></h3><p>如果您還沒有 Discord 機器人，請閱讀 <a href=\"https://github.com/denisnumb/discord-chat-mod/wiki/Quick-Start\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>快速入門指南</strong></span></a></p><p>在伺服器上安裝模組並運行，以生成 <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">discord_chat_mod-common.toml</span> 設定檔。配置必要的參數後啟動伺服器。如需額外功能，請在客戶端安裝此模組。</p><p>ℹ️ <strong>有關配置詳情與範例，請參閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/denisnumb/discord-chat-mod/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>Wiki</strong></span></a></strong></p><p><strong>重要事項：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>請確保在您應用程式的 Bot 分頁中啟用所有 <strong>Privileged Gateway Intents</strong></li>\n<li>請確保您的機器人在伺服器上擁有所有必要權限：<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">檢視頻道</span>、<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">傳送訊息</span>、<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">在討論串中傳送訊息</span>、<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">嵌入連結</span>、<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">附加檔案</span>、<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">釘選訊息</span>、<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">讀取訊息歷史</span>、<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">管理 Webhook</span></li>\n</ul><hr><p>ℹ️ 您可以在 <a href=\"https://github.com/denisnumb/discord-minecraft-chat/issues/new?template=feature_request.yml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">此處</span></strong></a> 提出新功能建議</p><p>🌐 若您想為模組新增您的語言支援，請閱讀 <a href=\"https://github.com/denisnumb/discord-chat-mod/wiki/Adding-localization-to-the-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">本指南</span></strong></a></p><p>🚀 您可以在 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/denisnumb/shop/discord-chat-images-develop-support-1504830\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Patreon</span></strong></a> 頁面支持開發工作</p><hr><h1>客戶端功能：</h1><h3>以下功能僅在客戶端安裝模組時生效。</h3><hr><h2>聊天圖片顯示</h2><h3>Discord 貼圖範例</h3><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/614ca97a-d132-4139-83a0-df09487ce344\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-11 012854\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5fd9db85-113a-48e6-b6a1-defe50beaebd\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-11 012917\"></p><h3>GIF 支援</h3><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b95fbb85-910e-4fce-86e9-9da0ef0984f5\" alt=\"gifs-ezgif com-speed\"></p><h3>多張圖片</h3><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/38aa0f32-d228-4820-93f5-d63854f5139c\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-11 014325\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0309898b-e66b-475b-9b8e-4a079aceb38c\" alt=\"images-ezgif com-speed\"></p><hr><h2>截圖分享按鈕</h2><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d6cbe85b-744b-4ce8-ab86-31d2d4622ec9\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-11 012147\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/06ae57e0-cdd6-4a77-bac2-cf583ed5e16e\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-11 012243\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c8f3c4fd-4c00-4dca-b226-cfdd5260804c\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-11 012403\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5b63a459-2bcf-4b3e-bea8-1250d8112033\" alt=\"screenshot-ezgif com-speed\"></p><hr><h2>聊天提及功能</h2><p>在遊戲聊天中輸入 <code>@</code> 以取得 Discord 用戶提及清單</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5c8fcd9d-9a8c-4d3b-9778-494ad952cfd9\" alt=\"mentions\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d2c8bc4-d6bd-4bdb-bd7b-0dc40099bdfa\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-11 011737\"></p><hr><h2>Discord Unicode 與自訂表情符號</h2><p>在遊戲聊天中輸入 <code>:</code> 以取得 Discord 伺服器的自訂與 Unicode 表情符號清單</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eedc957e-f505-48e2-ab99-548d53f4ded4\" alt=\"emojis\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/98c9c127-fc98-4b42-85a1-7508a9a2e164\" alt=\"emojis\"></p><hr><h2>本地伺服器</h2><h3>主機退出時自動關閉</h3><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5696c2cf-baf1-4b57-bc8e-ab192de2dc7f\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-11 014303\"></p><hr><h1>通用功能：</h1><h3>以下功能僅需在伺服器端安裝模組即可運作</h3><hr><h2>一般訊息</h2><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/41d2ef05-8eac-4af2-9e8e-dce7f94f9d67\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-11 005359\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dc89d6c8-d9ba-4dee-9d92-afe14214b6f6\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-11 005337\"></p><hr><h2>Webhook 模式</h2><p>預設模式</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c9e589b4-12a2-4388-a01b-64ff001ed035\" alt=\"515840977-78468d4e-5809-4866-8cc8-b016a060fcbf\"></p><p>啟用 Webhook 模式</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/61a01cd9-b40d-407d-88e3-f94023b819be\" alt=\"515843070-2b4c93e9-3242-4eed-86cc-acf609d665d2\"></p><p>ℹ️ <a href=\"https://github.com/denisnumb/discord-chat-mod/wiki/Webhook-mode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">進一步了解 Webhook 模式</a></p><hr><h2>Markdown 支援</h2><ul>\n<li>訊息樣式預覽僅在客戶端安裝模組時可用。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/04505f09-6cce-4f44-aa47-c5a775a586fb\" alt=\"image\"></p><p>ℹ️ <a href=\"https://github.com/denisnumb/discord-chat-mod/wiki/Markdown-and-colored-text\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">進一步了解 Markdown 與彩色文字</a></p><hr><h2>多 Discord 伺服器支援</h2><p>Minecraft 聊天：</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c10aaee2-7117-4d1f-8904-bbd1961b1ade\" alt=\"image\"></p><p>第一個伺服器聊天：</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cadba07b-9b9e-4487-82bb-1cce8a01ccb3\" alt=\"image\"></p><p>第二個伺服器聊天：</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/48cc41b2-a1bf-4d53-8566-dd08cacec2b7\" alt=\"image\"></p><p>ℹ️ <a href=\"https://github.com/denisnumb/discord-chat-mod/wiki/Discord-server-configuration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">進一步了解 Discord 伺服器配置</a></p><hr><h2>Minecraft 聊天自訂</h2><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6789a9c2-c817-45dd-b635-4c8e0eddae7f\" alt=\"image\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ffc80931-64a8-40b0-8030-73cbbb87bbd6\" alt=\"image\"></p><p>ℹ️ <a href=\"https://github.com/denisnumb/discord-chat-mod/wiki/Minecraft-Chat-Customization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">進一步了解聊天自訂</a></p><hr><h3>釘選狀態訊息與機器人狀態中的伺服器線上資訊</h3><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0a799918-0522-4031-841c-865b48a6a161\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-11 010642\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c8d36abf-3e77-450d-b82b-1ea296227d84\" alt=\"image\"></p><hr><h2>帶圖示與描述的進度以及死亡訊息（本地化）</h2><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f4523142-f88e-44ea-8544-05b75cc554a0\" alt=\"image\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cc4e6dd1-52bf-4d27-8e17-ac38786c494f\" alt=\"image\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5a5dd58a-014d-429a-a9c6-132cc70d008b\" alt=\"image\"></p><p>ℹ️ <a href=\"https://github.com/denisnumb/discord-chat-mod/wiki/Discord-Chat-Customization\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">進一步了解 Discord 訊息配置</a></p><hr><h2><code>/send_sticker</code> 指令</h2><ul>\n<li>貼圖預覽僅在客戶端安裝模組時可用。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/32f5849c-659d-486e-bd7b-ae57bf9488ea\" alt=\"image\"></p><hr><h2><code>/mention</code> 指令</h2><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c9eefdad-e838-48be-95d7-921a2d83f6a1\" alt=\"mention_command\"></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9bbfbd84-cd6b-4343-b502-8af9989c2331\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-11 011313\"></p>",
